sessments help you explore options and prepare for career success. The Office of Career Services and Internships resources include: connections with alumni, corporate recruiters, local businesses and the surrounding community. opportunities for research, externships, internships and jobs. interview preparation, job and internship search assistance, resume and cover letter development, and career counseling. access to the Director of Internships and Career Planning. Contact careers@pfeiffer.edu to make an appointment. Virtual resources include: Virtual Career Center: a student resource available at Blackboard > Organizations > VIrtual Career Center. Office of Career Services and Internships Office of Career Services and Internships E: careers@pfeiffer.edu Contact Us 800-338-2060 P.O. Box 960 Misenheimer, NC 28109-0960 Campus Locations Misenheimer Albemarle Online Campus Map Helpful Links How To Apply Visit Directory Accessibility Pfeiffer Library Title IX Employment Resources COVID-19 Policies State Authorization Accreditation Mission Statement Campus Store myPfeiffer IT Support © Copyright 2026 Pfeiffer University. All Rights Reserved. Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube flickr close navigation Apply Visit > Toggle \"Visit >\" submenu > Campus Map Virtual Campus Tour Request Info Give to Pfeiffer > Toggle \"Give to Pfeiffer >\" submenu > Give Now Current Initiatives Ways to Give Devoted & True Planned Giving Office of Advancement About Pfeiffer Toggle \"About Pfeiffer\" submenu > Why Pfeiffer Mission Statement President’s Office Campus Convenience Pfeiffer Legacy Academics Toggle \"Academics\" submenu > Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Academic Departments Academic Centers Pfeiffer Library Admissions & Aid Toggle \"Admissions & Aid\" submenu > Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Tuition and Fees Financial Aid Scholarships Career Success Toggle \"Career Success\" submenu > Career Services Explore Your Future Career Coaching and Internships For Employe