    "https://www.pfeiffer.edu/career-success/explore-your-options/": {
      "title": "Explore Your Future",
      "description": "Explore Your Future | Pfeiffer University Still accepting undergraduate and graduate applications for Fall 2026! Apply Today! Limited scholarships still available. Call 704-463-3060 or email admissions@pfeiffer.edu. Skip to content News Events Athletics For You > Toggle \"For You >\" dropdown > Current Students Parents Alumni Faculty & Staff Apply Visit > Toggle \"Visit >\" dropdown > Campus Map Virtual Campus Tour Request Info Give to Pfeiffer > Toggle \"Give to Pfeiffer >\" dropdown > Give Now Current Initiatives Ways to Give Devoted & True Planned Giving Office of Advancement About Pfeiffer Toggle \"About Pfeiffer\" dropdown > Why Pfeiffer Mission Statement President’s Office Campus Convenience Pfeiffer Legacy Academics Toggle \"Academics\" dropdown > Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Academic Departments Academic Centers Pfeiffer Library Admissions & Aid Toggle \"Admissions & Aid\" dropdown > Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Tuition and Fees Financial Aid Scholarships Career Success Toggle \"Career Success\" dropdown > Career Services Explore Your Future Career Coaching and Internships For Employers Student Life Toggle \"Student Life\" dropdown > Pfeiffer Journey Pfeiffer Life Pfeiffer Traditions Campus Life Religious Life Center for Health Sciences Search Toggle search interface Menu Toggle navigation Explore Your Future Home Career Success Explore Your Future Additional Navigation Career Success Career Coaching and Internships Explore Your Future Career Services For Employers Academics & Research , Undergraduate New Director of Nursing Outlines Program Vision Sep 08 Volunteer Fair 11:00 am – 2:00 pm, Stokes Student Center Lawn Sep 14 Fellowship of Christian Athletes 8:00 pm – 9:00 pm, Misenheimer – Grady Board Room (Stokes 207) More Events Explore Your Future Find your future with support from Pfeiffer. Are you wondering how your college education will help you in the real world? We’re here to show you. Pfeiffer offers a wide range of career exploration resources to support you as you determine your academic and professional pathways. On-campus Leadership Experience Visit the InterClub Council to find networking, real world experience, and leadership opportunities in student clubs and organizations. Contact the Francis Center for Servant Leadership and Faith Formation for volunteer and internship opportunities. Career Counselors Career counselors are available from the beginning of your academic program. Ask them about: Recruiting events Networking opportunities Job search tools Internships Resume preparation Interview skills Connections with alumni Company profiles Career research and self-assessment tools Responding to employment offers Email or visit the Office of Career Services and Internships , Monday–Friday from 8:30 a.m.–5 p.m. Virtual Resources Visit the Virtual Career Center for resources that will help you prepare an impressive resumé and cover letter. Find interview tips and mock virtual interview opportunities at Big Interview . Virtual Career Center Big Interview Graduate School Preparation Continuing your education through graduate or professional school? Learn test-taking skills Take practice tests for the GRE and Millers Analogies Test Schedule testing Contact Us Director of Internships and Career Planning Caroline Sowards E: careers@pfeiffer.edu Contact Us 800-338-2060 P.O. Box 960 Misenheimer, NC 28109-0960 Campus Locations Misenheimer Albemarle Online Campus Map Helpful Links How To Apply Visit Directory Accessibility Pfeiffer Library Title IX Employment Resources COVID-19 Policies State Authorization Accreditation Mission Statement Campus Store myPfeiffer IT Support © Copyright 2026 Pfeiffer University. All Rights Reserved. Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube flickr close navigation Apply Visit > Toggle \"Visit >\" submenu > Campus Map Virtual Campus Tour Request Info Give to Pfeiffer > Toggle \"Give to Pfeiffer >\" submenu > Give Now Current Initiatives Ways to Give Devoted & True Planned Giving Office of Advancement About Pfeiffer Toggle \"About Pfeiffer\" submenu > Why Pfeiffer Mission Statement President’s Office Campus Convenience Pfeiffer Legacy Academics Toggle \"Academics\" submenu > Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Academic Departments Academic Centers Pfeiffer Library Admissions & Aid Toggle \"Admissions & Aid\" submenu > Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Tuition and Fees Financial Aid Scholarships Career Success Toggle \"Career Success\" submenu > Career Services Explore Your Future Career Coaching and Internships For Employers Student Life Toggle \"Student Life\" submenu > Pfeiffer Journey Pfeiffer Life Pfeiffer Traditions Campus Life Religious Life Center for Health Sciences Search Search News Events Athletics For You > Toggle \"For You >\" submenu > Current Students Parents Alumni Faculty & Staff close search Search Search Secret Link"
