    "https://www.pfeiffer.edu/career-success/career-coaching-internships/": {
      "title": "Career Coaching and Internships",
      "description": "Career Coaching and Internships | Pfeiffer University Still accepting undergraduate and graduate applications for Fall 2026! Apply Today! Limited scholarships still available. Call 704-463-3060 or email admissions@pfeiffer.edu. Skip to content News Events Athletics For You > Toggle \"For You >\" dropdown > Current Students Parents Alumni Faculty & Staff Apply Visit > Toggle \"Visit >\" dropdown > Campus Map Virtual Campus Tour Request Info Give to Pfeiffer > Toggle \"Give to Pfeiffer >\" dropdown > Give Now Current Initiatives Ways to Give Devoted & True Planned Giving Office of Advancement About Pfeiffer Toggle \"About Pfeiffer\" dropdown > Why Pfeiffer Mission Statement President’s Office Campus Convenience Pfeiffer Legacy Academics Toggle \"Academics\" dropdown > Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Academic Departments Academic Centers Pfeiffer Library Admissions & Aid Toggle \"Admissions & Aid\" dropdown > Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Tuition and Fees Financial Aid Scholarships Career Success Toggle \"Career Success\" dropdown > Career Services Explore Your Future Career Coaching and Internships For Employers Student Life Toggle \"Student Life\" dropdown > Pfeiffer Journey Pfeiffer Life Pfeiffer Traditions Campus Life Religious Life Center for Health Sciences Search Toggle search interface Menu Toggle navigation Career Coaching and Internships Home Career Success Career Coaching and Internships Additional Navigation Career Success Career Coaching and Internships Explore Your Future Career Services For Employers Academics & Research , Undergraduate New Director of Nursing Outlines Program Vision Sep 08 Volunteer Fair 11:00 am – 2:00 pm, Stokes Student Center Lawn Sep 14 Fellowship of Christian Athletes 8:00 pm – 9:00 pm, Misenheimer – Grady Board Room (Stokes 207) More Events Career Coaching and Internship Find your purpose at Pfeiffer. Our goal is not only to help students be successful in their future careers, but also help them discover a purpose in life and a path they can be passionate about. Through mentoring and intentional career preparation, Pfeiffer positions each student on their own path to well-suited, rewarding careers. After exploring interests, skills and career options, we help students choose their academic programs, followed with help securing real-world experiences like internships, externships and summer jobs within their chosen field. Pfeiffer also mentors students through the processes of: Building a professional network Preparing an effective resume Practicing for interviews “ I cannot imagine my life without the experiences, friends and role models from my time at Pfeiffer University. My advisor helped me chart my career path in news and a Pfeiffer alum hired me for my first job. As I meet other alums, the Pfeiffer bond we share increases my sense of pride. ” Jennifer Moxley Communications Contact Us Sharon Robinson Director of Career Services & Internships E: sharon.robinson@pfeiffer.edu Contact Us 800-338-2060 P.O. Box 960 Misenheimer, NC 28109-0960 Campus Locations Misenheimer Albemarle Online Campus Map Helpful Links How To Apply Visit Directory Accessibility Pfeiffer Library Title IX Employment Resources COVID-19 Policies State Authorization Accreditation Mission Statement Campus Store myPfeiffer IT Support © Copyright 2026 Pfeiffer University. All Rights Reserved. Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube flickr close navigation Apply Visit > Toggle \"Visit >\" submenu > Campus Map Virtual Campus Tour Request Info Give to Pfeiffer > Toggle \"Give to Pfeiffer >\" submenu > Give Now Current Initiatives Ways to Give Devoted & True Planned Giving Office of Advancement About Pfeiffer Toggle \"About Pfeiffer\" submenu > Why Pfeiffer Mission Statement President’s Office Campus Convenience Pfeiffer Legacy Academics Toggle \"Academics\" submenu > Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Academic Departments Academic Centers Pfeiffer Library Admissions & Aid Toggle \"Admissions & Aid\" submenu > Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Tuition and Fees Financial Aid Scholarships Career Success Toggle \"Career Success\" submenu > Career Services Explore Your Future Career Coaching and Internships For Employers Student Life Toggle \"Student Life\" submenu > Pfeiffer Journey Pfeiffer Life Pfeiffer Traditions Campus Life Religious Life Center for Health Sciences Search Search News Events Athletics For You > Toggle \"For You >\" submenu > Current Students Parents Alumni Faculty & Staff close search Search Search Secret Link"
