 the possibilities, including: Possible interns Career-ready Pfeiffer graduates ready for full-time employment Organization partnerships with the university or faculty members Career-ready Pfeiffer graduates ready for full-time employment Have questions? Contact the Director of Career Services Enrollment/Degree Verifications On Pfeiffer University’s behalf, National Student Clearinghouse provides enrollment and degree verifications for employers, background screening firms, and educational institutions. Order degree verifications from www.degreeverify.org . Follow the instructions provided on the site to place your order—including delivery options and fees. If you need additional information, the Clearinghouse will contact the university to secure it for you. Contact Us Office of Career Services and Internships E: careers@pfeiffer.edu Contact Us 800-338-2060 P.O. Box 960 Misenheimer, NC 28109-0960 Campus Locations Misenheimer Albemarle Online Campus Map Helpful Links How To Apply Visit Directory Accessibility Pfeiffer Library Title IX Employment Resources COVID-19 Policies State Authorization Accreditation Mission Statement Campus Store myPfeiffer IT Support © Copyright 2026 Pfeiffer University. All Rights Reserved. Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube flickr close navigation Apply Visit > Toggle \"Visit >\" submenu > Campus Map Virtual Campus Tour Request Info Give to Pfeiffer > Toggle \"Give to Pfeiffer >\" submenu > Give Now Current Initiatives Ways to Give Devoted & True Planned Giving Office of Advancement About Pfeiffer Toggle \"About Pfeiffer\" submenu > Why Pfeiffer Mission Statement President’s Office Campus Convenience Pfeiffer Legacy Academics Toggle \"Academics\" submenu > Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Academic Departments Academic Centers Pfeiffer Library Admissions & Aid Toggle \"Admissions & Aid\" submenu > Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Tuition and Fees Financial Aid Scholarships Career Success Toggle \"Career Success\" submenu